# Glidedive Duo (flying): Bot2's Memnite cannot block it but Ornithopter can (CR 702.9b). On turn 3 the Duo attacks: the ground Memnite's block is refused (!), the flying Ornithopter blocks and
# takes 3, dying, while the Duo takes 0 and survives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Glidedive Duo
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Glidedive Duo.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Glidedive Duo > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
! Bot2.Block(Memnite > Glidedive Duo)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Glidedive Duo)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Memnite
Bot1.Battlefield.Glidedive Duo.Damage = 0
Bot2.Life = 18
